      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Diabetes India. Published by Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Botulinum toxin has been used for a variety of neuropathic conditions in diabetes mellitus. Meralgia paresthetica is a mononeuropathy of femoral nerve seen in diabetes and obesity with an unclear etiopathogenesis. We studied the role of botulinum toxin in resistant cases of meralgia paresthetica in type 2 diabetes."
      },
